---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout
  title="Image Credits & Licences | Materuni Hosts"
  description="Image sources, creators and licence information for photographs used on the Materuni Hosts website."
>
  <div class="credits-page">
    <header class="credits-hero">
      <span class="eyebrow">TRANSPARENCY · IMAGE RIGHTS</span>
      <h1>Image credits & licences</h1>
      <p>We use photographs to help guests understand the places and experiences they can discover with Materuni Hosts. Creator and licence information is kept here so it does not interrupt the photographs across the website.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="credits-list" aria-labelledby="commons-heading">
      <h2 id="commons-heading">Wikimedia Commons photographs</h2>
      <article class="credit-entry">
        <div>
          <h3>Rau Forest in Miembeni Ward, Moshi</h3>
          <p><strong>Photographer:</strong> Halidtz</p>
          <p><strong>Licence:</strong> Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0).</p>
          <p>Used to illustrate the Rau Forest experience. The displayed image may be cropped to fit the website layout; the original file remains at the source below.</p>
          <p class="credit-links"><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Rau_forest_in_Miembeni_Ward,_Moshi.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View original photograph on Wikimedia Commons</a><a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read CC BY-SA 4.0 licence</a></p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="credit-entry">
        <div>
          <h3>Moshi Town market</h3>
          <p><strong>Photographer:</strong> Ramadhani Mushi</p>
          <p><strong>Licence:</strong> Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).</p>
          <p>Used to illustrate the Moshi Town visit. The displayed image may be cropped to fit the website layout; the original file remains at the source below.</p>
          <p class="credit-links"><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Market_place_at_Moshi_Town.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View original photograph on Wikimedia Commons</a><a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read CC BY 4.0 licence</a></p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="credit-entry">
        <div>
          <h3>Traditional Chagga food: cooked bananas with meat and vegetables</h3>
          <p><strong>Photographer:</strong> Imaculate</p>
          <p><strong>Licence:</strong> Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0).</p>
          <p>Used to illustrate traditional Chagga cuisine in the cooking experience. This photograph represents Chagga food in Tanzania and is not presented as a documentary photograph of a specific Materuni Hosts cooking session.</p>
          <p class="credit-links"><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cooked_bananas_with_meat_and_vegetables.JPG" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View original photograph on Wikimedia Commons</a><a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read CC BY-SA 4.0 licence</a></p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="credits-note">
      <h2>Our image-use standard</h2>
      <p>We do not label a stock photograph as a real view of Materuni, Rau Forest or Moshi. Images presented as specific local places must have a verifiable connection to that place. Photographs supplied directly for Materuni Hosts are treated separately from third-party licensed images.</p>
      <p>For questions about an image or its rights, please contact <a href="mailto:hello@materunihosts.com">hello@materunihosts.com</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
  <style>
    .credits-page{max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(42px,7vw,84px) 22px 90px;color:#242421}
    .credits-hero{max-width:760px;margin-bottom:48px}
    .eyebrow{color:#98733c;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.16em}
    h1,h2,h3{color:#1a3322}
    h1{font:600 clamp(38px,6vw,66px)/1.04 "Cormorant Garamond",serif;margin:18px 0}
    h2{font:600 clamp(27px,3.5vw,38px)/1.12 "Cormorant Garamond",serif;margin:0 0 22px}
    h3{font:700 18px/1.35 Manrope,sans-serif;margin:0 0 12px}
    p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#55564f}
    .credits-list{border-top:1px solid #e6dfd3;padding-top:30px}
    .credit-entry{padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e6dfd3}
    .credit-entry p{margin:7px 0}
    .credit-links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 24px;margin-top:16px!important}
    .credit-links a,.credits-note a{color:#1a3322;font-weight:800;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}
    .credits-note{margin-top:44px;padding:28px;background:#f4efe6;border:1px solid #e6dfd3;border-radius:16px}
    .credits-note h2{font-size:30px}
    @media(max-width:600px){.credits-note{padding:22px}.credit-links{display:grid;gap:10px}}
  </style>
</SiteLayout>
